@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
title Внутренние зависимости модулей
left to right direction
rectangle TransactionModule as Transactions
rectangle AccountModule as Accounts
rectangle BudgetModule as Budgets
rectangle ReportModule as Reports
rectangle "IAccountValidationService\n<<interface>>" as AccountContract
rectangle "IExpenseQueryService\n<<interface>>" as ExpenseContract
Transactions ..> AccountContract : использует
Accounts -- AccountContract : реализует
Budgets ..> ExpenseContract : использует
Transactions -- ExpenseContract : реализует
Reports ..> Accounts : публичный контракт
Reports ..> Transactions : публичный контракт
Reports ..> Budgets : публичный контракт
note bottom of Reports
Интерфейсы и DTO:
PersonalFinance.Contracts
end note
@enduml
